        "id": "S1",
        "text": "Progress messages are logged: \"Moving N series to '<root folder>'\" at the start, per-series \"Moving <title> from '<src>' to '<dest>' (i/total)\", and \"Finished moving N series to '<root folder>'\" at the end."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
